{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1548","id":4049155859,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87xWTcT","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1548","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1548.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1548.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1548","number":1548,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix ParentCreationGate checkout receipt-trio source consistency","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Baseline\n\n- `origin/main`: `eac60b08a2d743ca96bbdbfcb3cee4a6cb3f1f94`\n- Branch: `codex/9709-parent-creation-checkout-receipt-source-fix`\n- Commit: `a65a8bef844074bc4e4954ec0899c4fe201b6791`\n\n## Root cause\n\nThe checkout lifecycle loaded the canonical independent-review receipt from the PR checkout, but the mirror-materialization and reviewer-ACL companion receipts were loaded through `resolver.show_bytes(source_ref, path)`, which resolved to `origin/main`. A valid receipt-only PR therefore failed before merge because its companion receipts could not yet exist on main.\n\n## Source contracts\n\n- Checkout contract mode now loads all three fixed canonical receipt paths from the current checkout through one mode-bound receipt-trio loader. It has no CLI root, source-ref, synthetic-resolver, or alternate receipt-path override.\n- Formal mode continues to load all three receipts exclusively from fixed `origin/main` Git bytes. Checkout receipts cannot make Formal GO.\n- Zero receipts remains the honest `receipt_absent` lifecycle. Any partial trio, malformed receipt, symlink, source read error, hash mismatch, stale reviewed implementation, or reviewed-bundle drift fails closed.\n- Receipt paths remain outside the reviewed implementation inventory. No receipt content contract or PaidExecutionGate policy was weakened.\n\n## Regression coverage\n\nA real temporary Git checkout/repository test now creates the reviewed implementation commit, pins `refs/remotes/origin/main`, and places a valid receipt trio at the three real canonical paths without using `SyntheticGitResolver` for the checkout lifecycle.\n\nThe regression matrix proves:\n\n- no-receipt checkout: contract rc 0, `receipt_absent`, Gate NO-GO, only `independent_review_pending_or_changes_required`;\n- receipt-only PR checkout: contract rc 0, `valid_receipt_present`, checkout Gate GO, no parent blockers;\n- each partial-trio permutation fails closed without mainline fallback;\n- Formal ignores a complete checkout-only trio;\n- Formal reaches GO only when the trio exists in simulated mainline Git bytes and the reviewed implementation is a main ancestor;\n- checkout deletion cannot be filled from main, while Formal ignores working-tree deletion/drift;\n- absolute/traversal paths, symlinks, malformed JSON, stale or non-ancestor SHA, wrong mirror/ACL hashes, missing/extra artifacts, source mixing, and alternate CLI source/root paths remain rejected.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/build_9709_campaign_a_parent_creation_contracts_v1.py --check`: pass, 31 artifacts\n- Checkout contract CLI: pass\n- Focused ParentCreationGate/workflow/active-manifest/parent-close tests: **80 passed**\n- Append-only ledger/durable store/host implementation tests: **59 passed**\n- `npm run quality:report-index`: pass, 0 violations\n- `git diff --check`: pass\n- Changed-file secret scan: 5 paths, 0 findings\n- Holdout/Gold/raw-provider diff scan: pass\n- Final Codex preflight: clean; branch ahead only because of this commit\n- Reviewed implementation inventory: **82 paths**\n- New checkout reviewed bundle hash: `8f3fa00111cfc38d23a28f7621b9c8546ad24597f913ca9457e2717e84f24c63`\n\nGitHub Actions are not currently claimed as passed; the results above are local verification.\n\n## Current Formal state\n\nThe real Formal ParentCreationGate remains honest:\n\n- verdict: `NO-GO`\n- only parent blocker: `independent_review_pending_or_changes_required`\n- deferred blockers: `independent_backup_target_missing`, `offline_recovery_key_copy_missing`\n- `paid_execution_gate_passed=false`\n\n## Explicit non-actions\n\n- provider calls = 0\n- remote writes = 0\n- Campaign A issues = 0\n- holdout/Gold/accepted rows = 0\n- canonical pass receipts created or committed = 0\n- canonical promotion = 0\n","created_at":"2026-07-14T02:17:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T10:32:16Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T10:32:15Z","merged_at":"2026-07-14T10:32:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"29798b0759352230b6ee2256a746d53ff82f774c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1548/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1548/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1548/comments","statuses_url":"ht